<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="es"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Nexo | Historias que conectan</title><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css"></head>
<body class="page-home"><%- include('partials/ambient') %><%- include('partials/header', { activePage: 'home' }) %>
<main class="home-stage"><section class="hero-copy reveal"><div class="signal"><i></i><span>COMUNIDAD EN MOVIMIENTO</span><b>2026</b></div><h1>Ideas con<br><em>otra dimensión.</em></h1><p>Publica lo que piensas, conecta con nuevas perspectivas y transforma una historia pequeña en una conversación enorme.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-glow magnetic" href="/posts"><span>Explorar historias</span><b>↗</b></a><a class="text-link" href="/posts/new">Crear publicación <span>→</span></a></div><div class="hero-stats"><div><strong>∞</strong><span>Ideas posibles</span></div><div><strong>01</strong><span>Espacio auténtico</span></div><div><strong>24/7</strong><span>Comunidad activa</span></div></div></section>
<section class="dimension-scene reveal" aria-label="Vista conceptual de Nexo"><div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="portal"><div class="portal-ring ring-1"></div><div class="portal-ring ring-2"></div><div class="portal-ring ring-3"></div><div class="core"><span>N</span></div></div><article class="story-panel tilt-card" data-tilt><div class="panel-top"><span class="live-dot"></span><small>HISTORIA DESTACADA</small><b>★</b></div><% if(featuredPost && featuredPost.imageUrl){ %><div class="story-visual featured-image"><img src="<%= featuredPost.imageUrl %>" alt="Imagen destacada de <%= featuredPost.title %>"></div><% }else{ %><div class="story-visual"><div class="visual-number">01</div><div class="visual-lines"></div></div><% } %><div class="story-body"><span><%= featuredPost && featuredPost.hashtags.length ? featuredPost.hashtags.slice(0,2).map(tag => '#'+tag.replace('#','')).join(' · ') : 'CREATIVIDAD · COMUNIDAD' %></span><h2><%= featuredPost ? featuredPost.title : 'Todo comienza cuando decides compartirlo.' %></h2><div class="author-line"><i><%= featuredPost && featuredPost.user ? featuredPost.user.name.charAt(0) : 'N' %></i><p><strong><%= featuredPost && featuredPost.user ? featuredPost.user.name+' '+(featuredPost.user.lastName||'') : 'Comunidad Nexo' %></strong><small><%= featuredPost ? 'Historia elegida' : 'Destaca una historia' %></small></p><b>↗</b></div></div><div class="shine"></div></article><div class="float-chip chip-a"><b>✦</b><span><%= featuredPost ? 'Selección destacada' : 'Nueva conexión' %></span></div><div class="float-chip chip-b"><b>#</b><span><%= featuredPost && featuredPost.hashtags.length ? featuredPost.hashtags[0].replace('#','') : 'nodejs' %></span></div></section></main><div class="scroll-cue"><span>SCROLL</span><i></i></div><%- include('partials/footer') %></body></html>
